          <rdf:li>I'm Bad At Tagging</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>adora may be slightly obsessed with wife</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>catra also starring as a stand in for salvation</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra is in Love with Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra Is a Tease (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mentioned Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mentioned Bow (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Married Bow/Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
